  ["Hold your conclusions humbly", ["\"The heart of the prudent getteth knowledge; and the ear of the wise seeketh knowledge\" (Proverbs 18:15). Industries change quickly. Revisit your analysis as new facts arrive, and keep any single company a modest part of your portfolio."]],
