  ["How bubbles form", ["A bubble forms when prices rise far above what the underlying businesses can justify, driven by excitement, easy money, and the fear of missing out. Common signs include stories that justify any price, borrowing to invest, newcomers promising quick riches, and the belief that \"this time is different.\""]],
